[{"_1":2,"_3":4},"root",{"_5":129},"en/routes/conteudo-do-cubo.tsx",{"_5":6},"data",{"_7":8,"_9":10,"_11":12,"_13":14,"_15":16,"_17":18,"_19":20,"_21":22,"_23":24,"_25":26},"tipo","metodo","cubo",{"_11":127,"_13":28,"_29":128},"id","top-first","nome","Top-first","nomeLongo","Top-first (layers and L4E)","termo",{"_29":124,"_125":126},"niveis",[91,52],"introducao","<p>The way to solve the Pyraminx for the first time: by layers, with yellow on the bottom. Tips and centers almost for free, the 3 bottom edges with two 3-move algorithms and the 3 top ones with 5 cases. Open each step with the Pyraminx in your hand.</p>\n","etapas",[33,34,35,36],"historias",[27],{"_13":28,"_29":30,"_31":32},"Pyraminx","endereco","/historia#pyraminx","resumo","The tetrahedron was created and patented by Uwe Mèffert and released by the Japanese company Tomy in 1981, at the height of the Rubik's Cube craze.",{"_11":117,"_13":118,"_39":119,"_41":120,"_43":121,"_44":-7,"_46":122},{"_11":110,"_13":111,"_39":112,"_41":113,"_43":114,"_44":-7,"_46":115},{"_11":80,"_13":81,"_39":82,"_41":83,"_43":84,"_44":85,"_46":47},{"_11":37,"_13":38,"_39":40,"_41":42,"_43":-7,"_44":45,"_46":47},"l4e","Faster: L4E","html","<p>Instead of the whole layer, build just the &quot;V&quot; (the 2 bottom edges that aren&#39;t in front) and solve the last 4 edges at once, with the <a href=\"/en/glossary#l4e\" class=\"termo-do-glossario\" title=\"On the Pyraminx: solves the 4 edges left after building the &quot;V&quot; on the bottom (the centers and 2 first-layer edges).\">L4E</a> cards and the other 10 from <a href=\"/en/glossary#l3e\" class=\"termo-do-glossario\" title=\"On the Pyraminx: with the first layer done, solves the 3 remaining edges.\">L3E</a>.</p>\n","grupos",[48],"pagina","treino","/pyraminx/treino?grupo=l4e","imagem","/imagens/diagramas/b788ffdfdc3680ac.svg",{"_11":49,"_13":50,"_51":52,"_53":54,"_55":56,"_57":58,"_29":59},"Pyraminx L4E","L4E","nivel","intermediario","casos",20,"conjunto",false,"ids",[60,61,62,63,64,65,66,67,68,69,70,71,72,73,74,75,76,77,78,79],"/pyraminx/l4e","PYRA-RightPolishFlip","PYRA-LeftPolishFlip","PYRA-SUS","PYRA-AntiSUS","PYRA-GoodNiky","PYRA-GoodSochi","PYRA-SuperSledge","PYRA-SuperHedge","PYRA-BadNiky","PYRA-BadSochi","PYRA-RightSpam","PYRA-LeftSpam","PYRA-BadSledge","PYRA-BadHedge","PYRA-BadSexy","PYRA-BadUgly","PYRA-BadRighty","PYRA-BadLefty","PYRA-DoubleSexy","PYRA-DoubleUgly","l3e","Last layer (L3E)","<p>The 3 top edges: 5 cases (the 4 Last Layer ones and 2 Flip), one card for each. The other 10 cases in the group are for <a href=\"/en/glossary#l4e\" class=\"termo-do-glossario\" title=\"On the Pyraminx: solves the 4 edges left after building the &quot;V&quot; on the bottom (the centers and 2 first-layer edges).\">L4E</a>.</p>\n",[88],{"_13":86,"_29":87},"/pyraminx/treino?grupo=l3e","Last layer","/pyraminx/ultima-camada",{"_11":89,"_13":90,"_51":91,"_53":92,"_55":56,"_57":93,"_29":94},"Pyraminx L3E","L3E","iniciante",15,[95,96,97,98,99,100,101,102,103,104,105,106,107,108,109],"/pyraminx/l3e","PYRA-Sune","PYRA-AntiSune","PYRA-LeftyBars","PYRA-RightyBars","PYRA-Sledge","PYRA-Hedge","PYRA-Clockwise","PYRA-Counterclockwise","PYRA-Righty","PYRA-Lefty","PYRA-Sexy","PYRA-LeftSexy","PYRA-2Flip","PYRA-DRFlip","PYRA-4Flip","primeira-camada","1st layer","<p>The 3 bottom edges, with <code>R U R&#39;</code> or its mirror, <code>L&#39; U&#39; L</code>.</p>\n",[],{"_13":111,"_29":116},"/imagens/diagramas/b9d102cda571f0ac.svg","/pyraminx/primeira-camada","pontas-e-centros","Tips and centers","<p>The tips turn on their own and the centers only turn in place: a few turns, no algorithm.</p>\n",[],{"_13":118,"_29":123},"/imagens/diagramas/09363e0a43468475.svg","/pyraminx/pontas-e-centros","/en/glossary#top-first","dica","A layer-by-layer Pyraminx method: the tips and centers, the 1st layer and the 3 edges left (L3E). To go faster, L4E.","pyraminx","/pyraminx/",{"_130":131,"_132":133},"cubos",[136,137,138,139,140,141,142],"idiomas",[134,135],"pt","en",{"_11":150,"_13":150},{"_11":149,"_13":149},{"_11":148,"_13":148},{"_11":147,"_13":147},{"_11":145,"_13":146},{"_11":127,"_13":28},{"_11":143,"_13":144},"skewb","Skewb","megaminx","Megaminx","5x5","4x4","2x2","3x3"]
